.#-----------------------------------------------------
.input|xwiki/2.1
.# Inline verbatim is rendered as code spans, using a backtick string that doesn't appear in the content and
.# padding spaces when needed so that the content is preserved. Empty inline
.# verbatim is dropped since code spans can't be empty.
.#-----------------------------------------------------
a {{{x|y}}} b {{{**not bold**}}} c {{{a`b}}} d {{{`a``b`}}} e {{{ f }}} g {{{}}} h {{{ }}} i
.#-----------------------------------------------------
.expect|markdown/1.2
.#-----------------------------------------------------
a `x|y` b `**not bold**` c ``a`b`` d ``` `a``b` ``` e `  f  ` g  h ` ` i